{"unit_id":"jiangnan-awa__dsh-user-message-jump#card-zh","repo":"jiangnan-awa/dsh-user-message-jump","commit":"09624eb46ebe062d6f899164aae5d1bc537eabcb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-user-message-jump（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在会话区域左侧提供用户消息快速导航。它把导航竖带注册到会话头部操作槽位，并从当前会话已加载的可见消息中读取 user 和 steering 节点。每条消息显示为竖向排列的短横线，悬停可查看消息文本预览与时间，点击即可滚动定位并短暂高亮对应消息。它还支持键盘聚焦与回车或空格跳转，适合需要在长会话中快速回看用户输入的 DSH Web 用户。运行需 DSH Web 模块系统、React 和会话 UI 槽位；不需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:55-75","src/client.js:115-123","src/client.js:149-203"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangnan-awa__dsh-user-message-jump#card-en","repo":"jiangnan-awa/dsh-user-message-jump","commit":"09624eb46ebe062d6f899164aae5d1bc537eabcb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-user-message-jump adds a tick rail to DSH Web chats for visible user and steering messages. Hover to preview; click to jump to and briefly highlight a message. Press Enter or Space on a focused tick. It helps revisit long chats and requires React and the conversation UI slot.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:55-75","src/client.js:115-123","src/client.js:149-203"]}
